{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Spyfall</strong> \ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f, a fun and fast-paced multiplayer game where you must be smart to win\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place in a living world full of people (NPCs)\u00a0\ud83d\udc65\ud83c\udf0d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map has its own unique atmosphere, characters, and tasks to complete \ud83d\udccb</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334280/extras/3dcd99e9d600d6747339ee08f3a19f44.poster.avif?t=1767708197\" width=616 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334280/extras/3dcd99e9d600d6747339ee08f3a19f44.webm?t=1767708197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334280/extras/3dcd99e9d600d6747339ee08f3a19f44.mp4?t=1767708197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Role</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>Play as either:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f <strong>Detective</strong>: Observe carefully \ud83d\udc40, analyze behavior \ud83e\udde0, and uncover the spies hiding in plain sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd76\ufe0f <strong>Spy</strong>: Blend in as a normal citizen \ud83d\udc64, complete secret tasks \ud83d\udccb, and avoid detection at all costs \ud83d\udea8</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 You can choose your role or play randomly for an unpredictable experience every match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.st