ers</strong> with <strong>up to 2 detectives</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player is the <strong>Detective</strong> who must find the spies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The other players are <strong>spies</strong> who pretend to be normal people and complete secret tasks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334280/extras/7aa7bc67b870ab5e03e07fb3069c5803.poster.avif?t=1767708197\" width=616 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334280/extras/7aa7bc67b870ab5e03e07fb3069c5803.webm?t=1767708197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334280/extras/7aa7bc67b870ab5e03e07fb3069c5803.mp4?t=1767708197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Maps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spyfall currently features <strong>6 unique maps</strong>, each with its own atmosphere, characters, and task styles:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334280/extras/da9faab8f10c5ec52df7b3a63ceac534.poster.avif?t=1767708197\" width=616 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334280/extras/da9faab8f10c5ec52df7b3a63ceac534.webm?t=1767708197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334280/extras/da9faab8f10c5ec52df7b3a63ceac534.mp4?t=1767708197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f The <strong>Detective</strong> must watch carefully \ud83d\udc40 and uncover the players hiding as spies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >bThe <strong>Spies</strong> must act normal \ud83d\udc64, complete their tasks \ud83d\udccb, and avoid getting caught \ud83d\udea8</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d Every map offers a different and exciting experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Will you be the smart <strong>Spy</strong> who stays hidden?<br>\u00a0Or the clever <strong>Detective</strong> who catches them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Clue","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3334280/f98df2ca8803ff4ba325c39f6943a1a4e77bd46f.jpg"},{"name":"Sharp Eye","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3334280/6ba9c307c2839193afb413d4cf330df7af83e3f2.jpg"},{"name":"Close Call","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3334280/3f950d1d1db41a517fee354827d8003e3896f3a2.jpg"},{"name":"Quick Thinker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3334280/4290394a17bfc8d2fdff0691331d4aa32c562035.jpg"},{"name":"Foolproof Strategy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3334280/d9da62b2cbbbb650413fb7b3aafa0d2e187081b1.jpg"},{"name":"First Task Done","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3334280/6363629677004419848ba655fc7d26b078252950.jpg"},{"name":"Task Specialist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3334280/4d4a9b55b2999fdf944d53ceace32c06db5480e6.jpg"},{"name":"Master of the Task","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3334280/61d1bc25637899dfc1c3260896e0b7e382495b07.jpg"},{"name":"Target Practice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/